sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server
    
    Note right of browser: The user writes text into the input field and clicks the Save button
    Note right of browser: The event handler calls e.preventDefault(), preventing the default form submission
    Note right of browser: The event handler creates a new note, adds it to the notes list, and re-renders the note list on the page

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note_spa
